    "donation": {
      "word": "DONATION",
      "definitions": [
        {
          "text": "The act of giving or bestowing; a grant. After donation there an absolute change and alienation of the property of the thing given. South.",
          "partOfSpeech": "noun"
        },
        {
          "text": "That which is given as a present; that which is transferred to another gratuitously; a gift. And some donation freely to estate On the bless'd lovers. Shak.",
          "partOfSpeech": "noun"
        },
        {
          "text": "(Law)",
          "partOfSpeech": "noun"
        },
        {
          "text": "The act or contract by which a person voluntarily transfers the title to a thing of which be is the owner, from himself to another, without any consideration, as a free gift. Bouvier. Donation party, a party assembled at the house of some one, as of a clergyman, each one bringing some present. [U.S.] Bartlett.",
          "partOfSpeech": "noun"
        }
      ],
